'''Red Slug''' (なめ（赤）''Name (Aka)'') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 6.1 Update|Version 6.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Red Slug
|image = E 341.png
|appearance = [[Sliming to Victory]]<br>
[[Citadel#Red|Red Citadel]]
|money drop = 200¢ - 790¢
}}

==Enemy==
The weakest of the slugs. Hardly not a threat but mainly support for enemies like [[Angelic Slug]] or [[Angelic Sleipnir]] in [[Slimy Stallions]].

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red cats]] can easily kill it in earlier stages, but in later stages [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] would be a better choice. However, anti-Red [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]] can be used to kill him in every stage.

